Date: 2025-02-12
U.S. Application No. 18/078,499

Page 4 of 4 Amendment Under 37 C.F.R. § 1.312 Dated: February 12, 2025 REMARKSIt is submitted that this Amendment has antecedent basis in the Application as originally filed, including the specification, claims and drawings, and that this Amendment does not add any new subject matter to the application. Applicant further submits that this Amendment conforms to the provisions of 37 C.F.R. § 1.312 and respectfully requests entry under the provisions therein.If the Examiner has any comments or questions regarding this Amendment, the Examiner is invited to contact the undersigned at the telephone number listed below.Respectfully submitted, DARROW MUSTAFA PC/Timothy A. Doyle/ Timothy A. Doyle Registration No. 51,262 (248) 567-6657 (248) 864-5960 Fax 41860 Six Mile Road Northville, Michigan 48168 {01272588}
